{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09009","headline":"同德精舍养疾寄河南兵曹东厅掾 · 韦应物","name":"同德精舍养疾寄河南兵曹东厅掾","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"逍遥东城隅，双树寒葱蒨。\n广庭流华月，高阁凝余霰。\n杜门非养素，抱疾阻良讌。\n孰谓无他人，思君岁云变。\n官曹亮先忝，陈躅慙俊彦。\n岂知晨与夜，相代不相见。\n缄书问所如，詶藻当芬绚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09009.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09009","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}